[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://unit_standard_material_alpha_fallback_lit"]

; What it holds: the surfaces a StandardMaterial3D draws around its opaque shading, through
; Godot's generated shader and the lit scene template (?litSurface=nodes). Six meshes stand on one
; ground under a shadowed sun: a GeometryInstance3D transparency fade, a visibility range fade, a
; material with alpha 0.5 that casts no shadow, a mesh whose material file cannot load, a mesh with
; no material, and a normal-mapped sphere under the project's screen-space roughness limiter.
; Every other material golden draws the classic path, so only this one shows a regression in these
; surfaces on the generated shader.

